# RSNA Knee project

- Runtime is the `rsna` CLI, not Cursor chat. Do not imply VS Code will auto-run agents when the folder opens.
- Do not invent competition metrics, SUBMITTED states, or GPU allocations.
- Do not load raw reports into cloud prompts; call local extraction.
- Do not download the full DICOM archive to macOS unified memory.
- Colab automatic GPU request is unsupported unless a documented API is wired. Use handoff.
- Max two subagents; honor `.cursor/agents` write ownership.
- Python package lives in `src/rsna_knee`. Keep notebooks thin.
